{"hw":"ἐνύπνιος","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἐνύπνιος</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἐνύπν-ιος</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">in sleep, in dreams appearing,</b> <span class=\"gk\">φαντάσματα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Th.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">710</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐνύπνιος ἦλθε</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">AP</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12.124</span> </span> (inc. or Artemon).</div></div>"}